      "created_at": "2016-01-03T23:21:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>All good artists need to draw something for fun just to keep the creative juices working. So trying to come up with something fun for Adam to draw. I think Adam should draw a picture of the greater than games team working away in the warehouse to ship all the villains. Make it a comedy picture and have fun with it.</p><p>anyone else have some ideas?</p>",
